    ["　　刚参加完“廷根英雄”表彰大会，心情还是有些激动，有了这个荣誉，看来上头很快就会提名我为下一任局长了。我也得把下面一些得力的人拔起来。\n　　那个愣头青不错，实力很强，就是嘴有点臭，整天把“该死的”挂在嘴边，整体还是很合我胃口的。\n　　光靠抓人可不够。我需要站得更高。只有站在更高的地方，才能把那些城市的腐肉连根挖掉。"] = " Just finished attending the \"Hero of Tingen\" commendation ceremony, and my mood is still a bit excited. With this honor, it seems that my superiors will soon nominate me as the next police chief. I also need to promote some capable people below me. \n That hot-headed kid is not bad; his strength is very strong, it's just that his mouth is a bit foul, and he keeps \"damn it\" on his lips all day, but overall he is still very much to my liking. \n Just catching people is not enough. I need to stand higher. Only by standing in a higher place can I dig out the rot of those cities by the roots.",
