    ["愚者教会信徒创设的福利制度。感谢各界人士对愚者教会的支持。\n聆听《愚者圣典》，赞美愚者！愿我主的恩典在您身边日夜相伴，成为您前行路上永不熄灭的灯火！\n购买立即获得<Highlight>300</>金镑以及<Highlight>2个</>活力方糖，并获得持续<Highlight>30</>天的福音券运势解读，以及解锁如下特权：\n<Highlight>※人脉快速互动次数增加：</>每日可额外获得<Highlight>5次快速互动次数</>，消耗道具可以直接获得与对应人脉的好感度。\n<Highlight>※玩法货币获取效率提升：</>获得<Highlight>冒险勋章</>、<Highlight>凯旋徽章</>以及<Highlight>同行纹章</>时，效率提升<Highlight>20%</>。\n<Highlight>※自定义传送信标：</>可在公共场景地图中记录<Highlight>福音尖碑坐标</>，记录完成后可随时传送到对应的<Highlight>福音尖碑</>处。\n<Highlight>※活力上限增加：</>活力累计上限增加<Highlight>1000</>点。\n此外，每日登录可获得<Highlight>100</>绑定金镑，累积登录还可额外获得更多<Highlight>活力方糖</>。\n愚者福音最多可持续<Highlight>180</>天，达上限后再次获得愚者福音将会转化为等额金镑。"] = "A welfare system created by the believers of the Church of The Fool. Thank you to all walks of life for your support of the Church of The Fool. \nListen to the 'Scripture of The Fool', praise The Fool! May the grace of my Lord accompany you day and night, and become the never-extinguishing lamp on your path forward! \nPurchase to immediately receive <Highlight>300</> pounds and <Highlight>2</> Vitality Sugar Cubes, and receive continuous <Highlight>30</> days of Gospel Ticket fortune readings, as well as unlocking the following privileges: \n<Highlight>※ Increased rapid interaction frequency with connections: </>Receive an additional <Highlight>5 rapid interaction attempts per day</>; consuming items can directly increase favorability with corresponding connections. \n<Highlight>※ Increased efficiency in obtaining gameplay currency: </>Efficiency increased by <Highlight>20%</> when obtaining <Highlight>Adventure Medals</>, <Highlight>Triumph Badges</>, and <Highlight>Companion Emblems</>. \n<Highlight>※ Custom Teleport Beacons: </>You can record <Highlight>Gospel Obelisk</> coordinates on public scene maps; once recorded, you can teleport to the corresponding <Highlight>Gospel Obelisk</> at any time. \n<Highlight>※ Increased Vitality cap: </>Cumulative Vitality cap increased by <Highlight>1000</> points. \nIn addition, you can receive <Highlight>100</> Bound Pounds by logging in daily, and accumulate logins to receive even more <Highlight>Vitality Sugar Cubes</>. \nThe Gospel of The Fool can last for a maximum of <Highlight>180</> days; once the limit is reached, obtaining the Gospel of The Fool again will be converted into an equivalent amount of pounds.",
